  "gold_statement": "these rumored technical setbacks could severely cap the scale-up capacity of Nvidia's future hardware. This perceived vulnerability may create a wider competitive window for alternative AI platforms, specifically AMD's MI500X and Broadcom-backed custom TPUs.",
