A1,A2,A3,B2,B3 Alongside the demo, the two companies announced an agreement to jointly explore nuclear-powered AI systems. The concrete version under study is a 30-megawatt closed-loop AI factory in Utah, which Valar’s own announcement says “consumes no water from the local community.”
